WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.485
In this video, you will hide your contest from the public with two taps, and bring it back when you are ready.

00:00:06.485 --> 00:00:07.581
Nothing is deleted.

00:00:07.581 --> 00:00:08.677
We start on the map.

00:00:09.579 --> 00:00:11.328
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:14.664 --> 00:00:17.182
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:19.049 --> 00:00:20.030
Then tap Allow.

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:27.287
Now look at the top of the map, beside the search box.

00:00:27.287 --> 00:00:30.113
See your picture, or your initial, in a circle?

00:00:30.113 --> 00:00:34.881
That is your account menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:34.881 --> 00:00:35.293
Tap it.

00:00:36.921 --> 00:00:38.819
In the menu, tap Your contests.

00:00:40.695 --> 00:00:44.109
That is where the contests you run, and the homes you entered, live.

00:00:44.809 --> 00:00:46.623
Tap Mine, your personal page.

00:00:48.355 --> 00:00:50.424
Tap Manage, next to your contest.

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:56.493
On the Overview, the Controls card has a row called Contest page.

00:00:56.493 --> 00:00:58.452
It says Public and on the map.

00:00:58.452 --> 00:01:00.918
That means anyone can find the contest.

00:01:01.821 --> 00:01:06.103
Need to stop everything for a moment, for example to fix a mistake?

00:01:06.103 --> 00:01:06.984
Tap Unpublish.

00:01:08.663 --> 00:01:13.334
The button now says, Tap again to unpublish, so it cannot happen by accident.

00:01:13.334 --> 00:01:13.932
Tap again.

00:01:15.786 --> 00:01:18.922
Entries and votes stop, and the contest leaves the map.

00:01:19.825 --> 00:01:21.944
A red notice now sits at the top.

00:01:21.944 --> 00:01:26.057
It says the contest is hidden, and that nothing has been deleted.

00:01:26.057 --> 00:01:28.550
Your team can still open this dashboard.

00:01:29.451 --> 00:01:31.648
When you are ready, tap Publish it again.

00:01:33.630 --> 00:01:41.416
The notice is gone, the Contest page row says Public and on the map again, and entries and votes carry on, with everything still in place.

00:01:42.318 --> 00:01:47.341
That is Unpublish: hide the contest, fix what you need to, and publish it again.

00:01:47.341 --> 00:01:48.334
Nothing is lost.

00:01:49.737 --> 00:01:52.403
Next up: Add co-organizers and judges.
